WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.465
Hey Guys. 
Colossians 3:2 says:

00:00:02.465 --> 00:00:06.622
Set your mind on the things above,
not on the things of Earth.

00:00:07.163 --> 00:00:10.261
You know if you do that
it changes&nbsp;your whole life.

00:00:10.791 --> 00:00:12.650
I think Togo agrees, look...

00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:15.463
Chibi, do you agree?

00:00:19.183 --> 00:00:20.497
It changes everything,

00:00:20.497 --> 00:00:24.402
because you know,
you can&nbsp;argue about the silliest things

00:00:24.402 --> 00:00:26.985
with your family

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.588
I cannot believe that there
are so many Christians

00:00:28.588 --> 00:00:30.544
who call themselves Christians
and still,

00:00:30.544 --> 00:00:33.328
they don't forgive
their family members.

00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:36.317
Jesus said&nbsp;
that you have to forgive them.

00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:40.408
If you don't want to forgive them,
then He's not going to forgive you.

00:00:41.479 --> 00:00:45.414
And how can you not forgive them
after what Jesus did for you?

00:00:45.414 --> 00:00:47.227
All the things that He forgave you...

00:00:48.441 --> 00:00:50.179
Set your mind on the things above.

00:00:50.179 --> 00:00:52.880
Think about the Eternal things
and not the temporary.

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:54.925
And love&nbsp;the people
around you.

00:00:55.568 --> 00:00:57.163
Remember that always.

